{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004525","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004525"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004525","label":"蔡澤御者未名（范睢蔡澤列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"其御者","mention_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0171"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0171","chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p028","quote":"其御者"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-079-fancai","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-079","chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0171"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai:p028"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-079-fancai"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0171","start":171,"end":174,"surface":"其御者","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004525","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p028","chapter_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji079-054","person_id":"cbr-p004525","surfaces":["其御者"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-079-fancai"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p028","quote":"蔡澤者，燕人也。游學干諸侯小大甚眾，不遇。而從唐舉相，曰：「吾聞先生相李兌，曰『百日之內持國秉』，有之乎？」曰：「有之。」曰：「若臣者何如？」唐舉孰視而笑曰：「先生曷鼻，巨肩，魋顏，蹙齃，膝攣。吾聞聖人不相，殆先生乎？」蔡澤知唐舉戲之，乃曰：「富貴吾所自有，吾所不知者壽也，願聞之。」唐舉曰：「先生之壽，從今以往者四十三歲。」蔡澤笑謝而去，謂其御者曰：「吾持粱刺齒肥，躍馬疾驅，懷黃金之印，結紫綬於要，揖讓人主之前，食肉富貴，四十三年足矣。」去之趙，見逐。之韓、魏，遇奪釜鬲於涂。聞應侯任鄭安平、王稽皆負重罪於秦，應侯內慚，蔡澤乃西入秦。"}],"rationale":"按全35段明示姓名與局部引語暫接，范睢張祿范叔范君應侯分說話範圍；蔡澤先生綱成君依具體敘事。越王事大夫種與句踐敘事相配，更新候選標籤保留ID。馬服／馬服子依同段長平角色暫接未補姓名，白公仍未定，韓子未強接韓非，喬松不補神仙，范中行族稱不接范睢。王之弟、改讀前止足及引古異說各留，預言與擬議方案不當史實核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:p028","text":"蔡澤者，燕人也。游學干諸侯小大甚眾，不遇。而從唐舉相，曰：「吾聞先生相李兌，曰『百日之內持國秉』，有之乎？」曰：「有之。」曰：「若臣者何如？」唐舉孰視而笑曰：「先生曷鼻，巨肩，魋顏，蹙齃，膝攣。吾聞聖人不相，殆先生乎？」蔡澤知唐舉戲之，乃曰：「富貴吾所自有，吾所不知者壽也，願聞之。」唐舉曰：「先生之壽，從今以往者四十三歲。」蔡澤笑謝而去，謂其御者曰：「吾持粱刺齒肥，躍馬疾驅，懷黃金之印，結紫綬於要，揖讓人主之前，食肉富貴，四十三年足矣。」去之趙，見逐。之韓、魏，遇奪釜鬲於涂。聞應侯任鄭安平、王稽皆負重罪於秦，應侯內慚，蔡澤乃西入秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"蔡澤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"李兌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004508","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"唐舉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004524","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004523","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"聖人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛論、未名角色或未行方案保留，不補姓名、成員及親屬；相士預言與富貴壽長願望不當生平已證實。"},{"id":"c-shiji-079-fancai:m028-0105","start":105,"end":107,"su